@startuml sequence-contact-support
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Sequence — Contact support (UC7)

actor Customer
participant "Frontend\n(React SPA)" as FE
participant "Phone / mail app\n(customer's device)" as Device

Customer -> FE: Click the support button\n(bottom-right, any page)
FE --> Customer: Show contact panel\n(phone, e-mail, office hours)
note right of FE
  Purely client-side —
  no backend call
end note

opt click phone or e-mail
  Customer -> FE: Click the phone number or e-mail
  FE -> Device: Open tel: / mailto: link
  Device --> Customer: Native phone / mail app opens
end

Customer -> FE: Close the panel
@enduml
